{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1164561893"}, "name":{"label":"jklm2129"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-22T07:02:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.90.0"}, "id":{"label":"13542623096"}, "title":{"label":"ADHD HEAVEN!"}, "content":{"label":"Okay so I don’t normally do reviews, i’ve been an iphone user since 2013 and i’ve done 2-3 the entire time so that says a lot! Also I found this app by turning my phone layout exclusively into large widgets (mostly) to make my routine more established and flow with ease. My idea was to find an app that I could add a widget that reminded me to hydrate first thing in the morning, but it has done so much more than that!!\n\nI always thought I was drinking lots of water and staying hydrated but having the reminders (and ability to adjust them based on personal preferences is awesome) actually made me realise I might not be fulfilling my hydration goals as well as I thought I was (and water is needed to absorb ALL nutrients from your food- a fun fact i learned through this app -you can toggle this option on and off, which again is a useful feature) \n\nBut most importantly this app gamifies hydration, by adding in customisation options, characters, WIDGETS, customisable notification sound etc. 10/10\n\nI also really love that the liquids are different colours and you can add your own drinks and their ml so you can see how your hydration is distributed between different beverages, i’m sure this would be very useful for those trying to reduce caffeine intake and I certainly could’ve benefitted from discovering this app earlier. \n\nOne thing I will say is i’m not sure if there is a free version or not as I signed up using the trial and will 100% be doing their one off payment for lifetime subscription as it genuinely is so affordable for all the features it offers!! But I think had I found this app during my hardships and only having the pay option or trial option would’ve meant I could’ve only used for that trial and then I would’ve deleted. Just something to think about in the cost of living crisis, perhaps the most streamlined version idk. (I know a lot of work went into the development of this app though you can tell from the offset so if it’s not possible to do that in a way that is fair to those who work on the app then perhaps it just is what it is)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
